    "detailed_description": "<strong>One Shot Arena</strong> is a fast-paced multiplayer arena where precision and agility are the keys to victory. Every hero can be taken down with a single hit, making each move critical. However, the game isn't just about avoiding danger; it's about mastering a wide range of abilities to dodge, deceive, and outsmart your opponents. Engage in intense battles where every move counts, and only the most skilled players will emerge as winners.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/81a63c33af40af497209cac9fa29afae.poster.avif?t=1743185665\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/81a63c33af40af497209cac9fa29afae.webm?t=1743185665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/81a63c33af40af497209cac9fa29afae.mp4?t=1743185665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><strong>\u2022 Diverse Abilities</strong> <br>Each hero has unique abilities and their own learning curve. Master your favorite heroes to gain an advantage on the battlefield.<br>Learn the strenghts and weaknesses of each hero to leverage your chances.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Multiplayer Fights</strong> <br>Battle against friends and foes in dynamic arenas. Available in 1v1, 2v2 and Free For All formats.<br>You can play each mode in ranked or unranked.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Skill-Based Gameplay</strong> <br>Collect victories and improve your rating to climb the leaderboards.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Instant Eliminations</strong> <br>Every hit counts. Reflexes and strategic thinking are crucial to defeat your enemies and win rounds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/7fbc73142aa4042cfe44e1c589539f01.poster.avif?t=1743185665\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/7fbc73142aa4042cfe44e1c589539f01.webm?t=1743185665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/7fbc73142aa4042cfe44e1c589539f01.mp4?t=1743185665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into One Shot Arena and experience the thrill of high-speed combat where every move matters. Can you outlast and outplay your rivals? The arena awaits your legend to be written.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>One Shot Arena</strong> is a fast-paced multiplayer arena where precision and agility are the keys to victory. Every hero can be taken down with a single hit, making each move critical. However, the game isn't just about avoiding danger; it's about mastering a wide range of abilities to dodge, deceive, and outsmart your opponents. Engage in intense battles where every move counts, and only the most skilled players will emerge as winners.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/81a63c33af40af497209cac9fa29afae.poster.avif?t=1743185665\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/81a63c33af40af497209cac9fa29afae.webm?t=1743185665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/81a63c33af40af497209cac9fa29afae.mp4?t=1743185665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><strong>\u2022 Diverse Abilities</strong> <br>Each hero has unique abilities and their own learning curve. Master your favorite heroes to gain an advantage on the battlefield.<br>Learn the strenghts and weaknesses of each hero to leverage your chances.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Multiplayer Fights</strong> <br>Battle against friends and foes in dynamic arenas. Available in 1v1, 2v2 and Free For All formats.<br>You can play each mode in ranked or unranked.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Skill-Based Gameplay</strong> <br>Collect victories and improve your rating to climb the leaderboards.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Instant Eliminations</strong> <br>Every hit counts. Reflexes and strategic thinking are crucial to defeat your enemies and win rounds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/7fbc73142aa4042cfe44e1c589539f01.poster.avif?t=1743185665\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/7fbc73142aa4042cfe44e1c589539f01.webm?t=1743185665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133110/extras/7fbc73142aa4042cfe44e1c589539f01.mp4?t=1743185665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into One Shot Arena and experience the thrill of high-speed combat where every move matters. Can you outlast and outplay your rivals? The arena awaits your legend to be written.",
